OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 102, dies after being 'pushed
OL,4,Aoff pub stage' while asking for music
OL,5,Ato be turned down
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 102-year-old man with dementia who
OL,8,Fwas allegedly pushed at a Cwmbran pub
OL,9,Fdied nearly two weeks later, an inquest
OL,10,Fhas heard.
OL,12,FPhilip Ormerod, from Cwmbran, Torfaen,
OL,13,Fwas taken to hospital in a critical
OL,14,Fcondition following an incident at the
OL,15,FCrows Nest pub in the town on 1 August.
OL,17,FHe is understood to have been visiting
OL,18,Fthe pub for a drink when he went on to
OL,19,Fa stage in the venue to complain about
OL,20,Fthe volume of the music.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
